<view class="page about-page">
  <view class="eyebrow">YULONG / CHEMISTRY</view>
  <view class="about-heading"><view class="page-title">你好，我是玉龙。</view><text class="hello-mark">✦</text></view>
  <view class="subtitle">在这里，和你一起把化学学明白。</view>
  <view class="creator-card">
    <view class="creator-stamp"><image src="/assets/yulong-avatar.webp" mode="aspectFill"/><view>玉龙化学</view></view>
    <view class="creator-name">{{brand.teacherName}}</view>
    <view class="creator-role">玉龙化学 · 化学课程与知识分享</view>
    <view class="creator-divider"></view>
    <view class="creator-statement">{{brand.tagline}}</view>
    <view class="creator-copy">欢迎来到我的线上课堂。你可以在这里了解课程、观看已购课时、整理配套讲义，也可以到我的 B站主页，认识课堂之外的我。</view>
    <view class="creator-signature">玉龙 <text>/ {{brand.name}}</text></view>
  </view>
  <view class="section-head"><view class="section-title">我的课堂，怎样学习</view><text class="section-index">01—03</text></view>
  <view class="learning-note"><text class="note-number">01</text><view><view class="note-title">从一门适合你的课开始</view><view class="note-copy">先看课程介绍与目录，再安排自己的学习节奏。</view></view></view>
  <view class="learning-note"><text class="note-number">02</text><view><view class="note-title">听懂之后，再回看一遍</view><view class="note-copy">已购课时支持回看，学习进度会为你记录。</view></view></view>
  <view class="learning-note"><text class="note-number">03</text><view><view class="note-title">把知识留在笔记里</view><view class="note-copy">结合课程讲义整理知识点，让理解更扎实。</view></view></view>
  <view class="bilibili-card">
    <view class="between"><view class="bilibili-label">bilibili <text>我的另一个课堂</text></view><text class="external-arrow">↗</text></view>
    <view class="bilibili-title">到 B站，认识更多面的玉龙</view>
    <view class="bilibili-uid" selectable>主页 UID · {{brand.bilibiliUid}}</view>
    <button class="bilibili-button" bindtap="copyBilibili" loading="{{copying}}" disabled="{{copying}}">复制 B站主页链接 ↗</button>
    <view class="bilibili-help">复制后在浏览器粘贴打开，也可在 B站搜索以上 UID。</view>
  </view>
  <button class="primary explore-button" bindtap="courses">回到玉龙的课程 →</button>
  <view class="brand-footer">{{brand.name}} · 认真对待每一次理解</view>
</view>
